      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm! It’s been happening with me as well since a few days ago. Even before this bug arrived, I always found that there was something wrong with it, like whenever a friend of mine would be online for let’s say 2 hours, and then log off the game, I would go immediately to the website and search my friend’s name, only to read that they were last seen 2 hours ago, where it would’ve been more logical to say that they were last seen a few seconds ago or at least less than a minute ago.\n\nPerhaps instead of starting the \"timer\" whenever someone’s login in, the website should start it whenever someone logs OUT of VRChat, to make it as accurate as possible.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
